# Copy to .env.local (ignored by git) to change the backend a local build uses.
# The app has no secrets: the Google client and session secrets are Worker secrets (setup.md).
#   cloudflare  the DMC Worker on the same origin (default for production builds)
#   mock        the in-browser development backend (default for npm run dev)
#   none        no accounts or Library
# VITE_BACKEND=mock
